[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036723411","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108270#issuecomment-3036723411","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108270","id":3036723411,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61ALjT","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T15:37:10Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T15:37:10Z","body":"I can't notice any difference between the three when clicking between the CanvasItem and AnimationPlayer in the MRP. The CanvasItem takes slightly longer to switch the Inspector panel over than the AnimationPlayer, but that seems unaffected by which shader is attached and is a small fraction of a second on my machine. Do I need to be doing more than clicking between the two with the Animation tab open and swapping out the shader on the AttachShaderHere?\n\nWhen opening the files in the Shader Editor, there *is* a noticeable speed difference when opening the three, although it's still under a second. The fast one opens basically instantly, whereas the crash one takes most of a second to load.\n\n> Godot 